pino-lens
=========

This directory is an independent, MIT-licensed module that reads the output of
pino. It does not vendor or copy pino's implementation.

Upstream project
----------------
pino — https://github.com/pinojs/pino
Version read for this work: 10.4.0 (upstream commit b29dbe9)
